<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Singleton SD Brand System — {{VERSION}}</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Public snapshot of the Singleton SD brand system: marks, usage, foundations, and export packs. Print this page to save a PDF."
    />
    <link href="https://tokens.design.singletonsd.com/css/root/light/_variables.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://tokens.design.singletonsd.com/css/light/_variables.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://tokens.design.singletonsd.com/css/dark/_variables.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://fonts.cdnfonts.com/css/open-sauce-sans" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="manifest" href="../favicons/circle/bg-none/site.webmanifest" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="../favicons/circle/bg-none/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="../favicons/circle/bg-none/favicon-32x32.png" />
    <style>
      :root {
        --ink: var(--ssd-color-gray-900, #292c30);
        --muted: var(--ssd-color-gray-700, #60656b);
        --paper: var(--ssd-color-background-default, #ffffff);
        --wash: var(--ssd-color-gray-100, #f5f6f7);
        --line: var(--ssd-color-border-default, #c9ccd1);
        --brand: var(--ssd-color-yellow-light-500, #c89200);
        --inverse: var(--ssd-color-background-inverse, #000000);
        --radius: var(--ssd-radius-md, 8px);
        --font: var(--ssd-font-family-body, "Open Sauce Sans"), system-ui, sans-serif;
      }

      [data-theme="dark"] {
        --ink: var(--ssd-color-gray-100, #f5f6f7);
        --muted: var(--ssd-color-gray-400, #b3b7bd);
        --paper: var(--ssd-color-gray-900, #292c30);
        --wash: #111111;
        --line: var(--ssd-color-gray-700, #60656b);
        --inverse: #000000;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: var(--ink);
        background: var(--wash);
      }
      a { color: var(--ink); }
      img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
      h1, h2, h3 { letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 700; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem); margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
      h2 { font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
      h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
      p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--muted); }
      .wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
      .site-nav {
        position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 5;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 92%, transparent);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .site-nav .wrap {
        display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 20px;
        align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        padding-top: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .nav-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 14px; font-size: 13px; }
      .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); }
      .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
      .nav-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
      button, .btn {
        font: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
        border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
        border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 12px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none;
      }
      section.page {
        background: var(--paper);
        margin: 24px auto;
        padding: 48px 0 56px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 16px;
      }
      .kicker {
        font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brand); margin: 0 0 8px;
      }
      .grid-2 { display: grid; gap: 20px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); }
      .grid-4 { display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); }
      .panel {
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 24px;
        background: var(--paper);
      }
      .panel.dark { background: #111; border-color: #111; }
      .panel.white { background: #fff; }
      .panel.ok { outline: 2px solid #2f855a; outline-offset: 2px; }
      .panel.avoid { outline: 2px solid #c53030; outline-offset: 2px; }
      .caption { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 8px; }
      .mark { width: 96px; height: 96px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .wordmark { width: min(100%, 420px); margin: 0 auto; }
      .cover {
        background: #111; color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 72px 0; margin: 24px auto;
      }
      .cover p { color: #b3b7bd; }
      .cover .kicker { color: var(--brand); }
      .swatch {
        height: 72px; border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .swatch-label { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 6px; color: var(--muted); word-break: break-all; }
      .type-row { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .type-row strong { display: block; }
      ul.rules { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; color: var(--muted); }
      ul.rules li { margin: 0 0 8px; }
      .do { border-top: 3px solid #2f855a; }
      .dont { border-top: 3px solid #c53030; }
      .check { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
      .check li { padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); }
      .letter {
        background: #fff; color: #292c30; min-height: 280px;
        padding: 28px; border: 1px solid #e1e3e6; border-radius: var(--radius);
        display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
      }
      .letter .tiny { font-size: 12px; color: #60656b; }
      .og { width: 100%; border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .hint { font-size: 13px; }
      footer { padding-bottom: 32px; }
      @media print {
        .site-nav, .nav-actions, .print-hide { display: none !important; }
        body { background: #fff; }
        section.page, .cover {
          break-after: page; border: 0; border-radius: 0; margin: 0; box-shadow: none;
        }
        a { text-decoration: none; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="site-nav print-hide">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="#cover">Cover</a>
          <a href="#foundations">Foundations</a>
          <a href="#logos">Logos</a>
          <a href="#usage">Usage</a>
          <a href="#stationery">Stationery</a>
          <a href="#social">Social</a>
          <a href="#export">Export</a>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-actions">
          <button type="button" id="theme-toggle">Dark</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="window.print()">Print / PDF</button>
          <a class="btn" href="../">Asset catalog</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="cover" id="cover">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="kicker">00 — Cover</p>
        <img class="wordmark" src="../logo/wordmark/compact/dark/bg-none/1280.png" alt="Singleton SD compact wordmark" />
        <h1 style="margin-top: 32px;">Brand System</h1>
        <p>
          Public snapshot of the Penpot file <strong style="color:#fff">Singleton SD — Brand System</strong>.
          Tokens: <code>@singleton-sd/tokens</code> · Assets: <code>@singleton-sd/assets</code> · CSS: <code>--ssd-*</code>
        </p>
        <p class="hint">
          This page is the shareable view. Penpot stays the working style guide.
          Use Print → Save as PDF for a file copy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page" id="foundations">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="kicker">01 — Foundations</p>
        <h2>Color, type, space, radius</h2>
        <p>
          Values come from <a href="https://tokens.design.singletonsd.com/">tokens.design.singletonsd.com</a>.
          Toggle Color / Light and Color / Dark in Penpot to restyle semantics. This snapshot shows the light set, with a dark page toggle.
        </p>
        <h3>Semantic color</h3>
        <div class="grid-4">
          <div><div class="swatch" style="background: var(--ssd-color-text-default)"></div><div class="swatch-label">text.default</div></div>
          <div><div class="swatch" style="background: var(--ssd-color-text-muted)"></div><div class="swatch-label">text.muted</div></div>
          <div><div class="swatch" style="background: var(--ssd-color-text-subtle)"></div><div class="swatch-label">text.subtle</div></div>
          <div><div class="swatch" style="background: var(--ssd-color-text-inverse); border-color:#111"></div><div class="swatch-label">text.inverse</div></div>
          <div><div class="swatch" style="background: var(--ssd-color-background-brand)"></div><div class="swatch-label">background.brand</div></div>
          <div><div class="swatch" style="background: var(--ssd-color-background-muted)"></div><div class="swatch-label">background.muted</div></div>
          <div><div class="swatch" style="background: var(--ssd-color-background-inverse)"></div><div class="swatch-label">background.inverse</div></div>
          <div><div class="swatch" style="background: var(--ssd-color-border-focus)"></div><div class="swatch-label">border.focus</div></div>
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 32px;">Typography</h3>
        <div class="type-row"><strong style="font-size: 36px;">Heading / Open Sauce Sans 700</strong><span class="caption">--ssd-font-family-heading · --ssd-font-size-500</span></div>
        <div class="type-row"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Body / Open Sauce Sans 400 — used for UI copy and this guide.</span><span class="caption">--ssd-font-family-body · --ssd-font-size-300</span></div>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 32px;">Space &amp; radius</h3>
        <p>Space scale: 4 / 8 / 16 / 24 / 32 / 48 / 64. Radius: sm 4 · md 8 · lg 12 · xl 16 · full.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page" id="logos">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="kicker">02 — Logos &amp; Marks</p>
        <h2>Library masters</h2>
        <p>
          Naming: <strong>light</strong> = dark ink for light fields · <strong>dark</strong> = light ink for dark fields.
          Prefer these files (or Penpot component instances) over recreating the lockup in type.
        </p>
        <h3>Icon mark</h3>
        <div class="grid-2">
          <div class="panel white">
            <img class="mark" src="../logo/static/light/circle/bg-none/512.png" alt="S-mark light" />
            <div class="caption">S-mark · light (for light backgrounds)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel dark">
            <img class="mark" src="../logo/static/dark/circle/bg-none/512.png" alt="S-mark dark" />
            <div class="caption" style="color:#b3b7bd">S-mark · dark (for dark backgrounds)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 32px;">Wordmarks</h3>
        <div class="grid-2">
          <div class="panel white">
            <img class="wordmark" src="../logo/wordmark/compact/light/bg-white/640.png" alt="Compact light" />
            <div class="caption">Compact · light — nav, signatures</div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel dark">
            <img class="wordmark" src="../logo/wordmark/compact/dark/bg-black/640.png" alt="Compact dark" />
            <div class="caption" style="color:#b3b7bd">Compact · dark — nav, signatures</div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel white">
            <img class="wordmark" src="../logo/wordmark/legal/light/bg-white/640.png" alt="Legal light" />
            <div class="caption">Legal · light — letters, contracts (SOFTWARE PTY LTD)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel dark">
            <img class="wordmark" src="../logo/wordmark/legal/dark/bg-black/640.png" alt="Legal dark" />
            <div class="caption" style="color:#b3b7bd">Legal · dark — letters, contracts</div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel white">
            <img class="wordmark" src="../logo/wordmark/descriptor/light/bg-white/640.png" alt="Descriptor light" />
            <div class="caption">Descriptor · light — web, marketing</div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel dark">
            <img class="wordmark" src="../logo/wordmark/descriptor/dark/bg-black/640.png" alt="Descriptor dark" />
            <div class="caption" style="color:#b3b7bd">Descriptor · dark — web, marketing</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page" id="usage">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="kicker">03 — Logo usage</p>
        <h2>Clear space, contrast, do / don’t</h2>
        <p>Clear space ≈ mark height. Do not stretch. Prefer library instances and published packs.</p>
        <div class="grid-2">
          <div class="panel do">
            <h3>Do</h3>
            <ul class="rules">
              <li>Keep aspect ratio — never stretch the mark or wordmark.</li>
              <li>Clear space ≈ height of the S-mark (or wordmark cap height).</li>
              <li>Use light masters on light fields (dark ink); dark masters on dark fields.</li>
              <li>Prefer library component instances from Logos &amp; Marks.</li>
              <li>Email: compact PNG. Documents: legal SVG/PNG.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="panel dont">
            <h3>Don’t</h3>
            <ul class="rules">
              <li>No drop shadows, outlines, or recolored brand gold.</li>
              <li>Do not rotate, skew, or crop through the mark.</li>
              <li>Do not place light masters on dark fields (or vice versa).</li>
              <li>Do not recreate wordmarks in free text — use masters.</li>
              <li>Do not use SOTFWARE spelling — SOFTWARE PTY LTD only.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 32px;">Background contrast</h3>
        <div class="grid-4">
          <div>
            <div class="panel white ok">
              <img class="wordmark" src="../logo/wordmark/compact/light/bg-white/640.png" alt="OK light on white" />
            </div>
            <div class="caption">OK · light on white</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="panel dark ok">
              <img class="wordmark" src="../logo/wordmark/compact/dark/bg-black/640.png" alt="OK dark on black" />
            </div>
            <div class="caption">OK · dark on black</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="panel dark avoid">
              <img class="wordmark" src="../logo/wordmark/compact/light/bg-none/640.png" alt="Avoid light on black" />
            </div>
            <div class="caption">Avoid · light on black</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="panel white avoid">
              <img class="wordmark" src="../logo/wordmark/compact/dark/bg-none/640.png" alt="Avoid dark on white" />
            </div>
            <div class="caption">Avoid · dark on white</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page" id="stationery">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="kicker">04 — Trademark &amp; stationery</p>
        <h2>Legal wordmark on documents</h2>
        <p>
          Letterhead / contracts: legal wordmark. Footer: same artwork at smaller size.
          Packs live under <code>dist/documents/</code>. Trademark line (placeholder):
          <em>Singleton Software Pty Ltd. All rights reserved.</em>
        </p>
        <div class="letter">
          <img src="../documents/letterhead/light/bg-none/1200.png" alt="Legal letterhead" style="width:min(100%,360px)" />
          <p class="tiny">Contract body uses Open Sauce Sans. Keep the legal lockup; do not retype SOFTWARE PTY LTD.</p>
          <img src="../documents/footer/light/bg-none/400.png" alt="Legal footer" style="width:min(100%,180px)" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page" id="social">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="kicker">05 — Social &amp; web assets</p>
        <h2>Avatar, OG, favicon</h2>
        <p>Crops from S-mark / wordmark masters. Export packs ship from this package.</p>
        <div class="grid-2">
          <div>
            <img class="og" src="../og-image/light/og-default.jpg" alt="Open Graph light" />
            <div class="caption">OG · light</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <img class="og" src="../og-image/dark/og-default.jpg" alt="Open Graph dark" />
            <div class="caption">OG · dark</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <div class="panel white" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;">
            <img class="mark" src="../favicons/circle/bg-none/android-chrome-512x512.png" alt="Favicon" />
            <div class="caption">Favicon / PWA · circle / bg-none</div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel white">
            <img class="wordmark" src="../email/signature/light/bg-none/640.png" alt="Email signature compact" />
            <div class="caption">Email signature · compact PNG</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page" id="export">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="kicker">06 — Export checklist</p>
        <h2>Before publishing assets</h2>
        <ul class="check">
          <li>SVG + PNG masters committed for S-mark and wordmark roles (legal / descriptor / compact).</li>
          <li>Penpot library components updated on Logos &amp; Marks.</li>
          <li><code>yarn build-wordmark-assets</code> — dist/logo/wordmark/…</li>
          <li><code>yarn build-email-docs-assets</code> — dist/email + dist/documents packs.</li>
          <li>BRAND.md + email/documents READMEs match published CDN paths.</li>
          <li>Spelling check: SOFTWARE PTY LTD (never SOTFWARE).</li>
          <li>Release @singleton-sd/assets after human review.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="hint" style="margin-top: 24px;">
          Catalog: <a href="https://assets.singletonsd.com/">assets.singletonsd.com</a>
          · Tokens: <a href="https://tokens.design.singletonsd.com/">tokens.design.singletonsd.com</a>
          · Rules: <a href="https://gitlab.com/singleton-sd/design-system/assets/-/blob/main/BRAND.md">BRAND.md</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

{{FOOTER}}
    <script>
      const root = document.documentElement;
      const btn = document.getElementById("theme-toggle");
      function sync() {
        const dark = root.getAttribute("data-theme") === "dark";
        btn.textContent = dark ? "Light" : "Dark";
      }
      btn.addEventListener("click", () => {
        root.setAttribute("data-theme", root.getAttribute("data-theme") === "dark" ? "light" : "dark");
        sync();
      });
      sync();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
